sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as Source<br/>Tier0 archive live
    participant DB as Data store<br/>Mongo PostgreSQL
    participant Q as QA<br/>evidence
    participant O as Ops approval<br/>promotion
    participant K as Knowledge<br/>ontology graph vector
    participant W as Workflow<br/>Airflow LangGraph
    participant A as App<br/>FastAPI SQLLM
    S->>DB: load archive or raw event
    DB->>Q: expose candidates and references
    Q->>O: create promotion request
    O->>DB: approved canonical write only
    K-->>A: provide grounded context
    A->>DB: run guarded SELECT evidence query
    A->>W: register background job
    W->>DB: run batch replay or report task
    W-->>A: publish artifact status
    Note over Q,O: QA pass alone does not promote canonical facts
